flowchart TB
    A[AI Candidate Evidence] --> B{Authoritative?}
    B -- No --> X[Do Not Use for Action]
    B -- Yes --> C{Fresh / Timestamped?}
    C -- No --> Y[Defer or Escalate]
    C -- Yes --> D{Version Pinned?}
    D -- No --> Y
    D -- Yes --> E{Authorized?}
    E -- No --> Z[Redact or Refuse]
    E -- Yes --> F{Conflicts?}
    F -- Yes --> W[Conflict Route / Human Review]
    F -- No --> G[Admissible Evidence]
    G --> H[Answer or Act]
